## novelproposals.db — Schema and Records

This file is the structured database companion to novelproposals.md.
Format: TOML-like records, one per proposal. Append new records; do not delete old ones.
Status values: new | sent | accepted | rejected | paused | stale
Recommendation values: A-Ignore B-Watch C-Backlog D-Prototype-Later E-Prototype-Now F-Design-Agent G-Firmware-Agent H-P2P-Agent I-Deploy-Agent J-DevOps-Agent K-Mobile-Client L-Codebase-Agent M-Bitcoin-Compliance N-Security-Auditor O-Orchestrator-Now

